# Android 9 guest runtime · generated images and build outputs
#
# Only source (C/C++/Java/Python/shell, lists, patches, headers) is committed.
# Everything below is either multi-GB guest material or reproducible output.

# Generated prepared runtime (assets + jniLibs staged for the APK)
prepared/
# APK 侧旧格式 payload（客体 .so 在 assets/<prefix>/lib/**；Gradle 消费这一份，
# 见 docs/rom-package/04 §4 —— 产物，不是源码）
prepared-apk/
# ROM 包（dist/versebox-<id>-<version>.zip，docs/rom-package/05 §5）
dist/

# Redroid 9 image: tarball, extracted rootfs, and the path index
downloads/
rootfs/
rootfs-index.json

